! CENTER with ON_PASS=2: on passes 0, 1 and 3 it does nothing and the beam stays on the device (an idle
! pass); on pass 2 it centers X and XP. Only an output file, so the particles must be elegant's.
D: DRIF, L=0.5
K: KICKER, HKICK=2e-4, VKICK=-1e-4
Q1: QUAD, L=0.2, K1=0.5
Q2: QUAD, L=0.2, K1=-0.5
CEN: CENTER, X=1, XP=1, ON_PASS=2
BL: LINE=(K, D, Q1, D, CEN, Q2, D)
